This repository contains no upstream source code and no model weights. At run
time it imports an unmodified checkout of thu-ml/Causal-Forcing (Apache
License 2.0) that the administrator installs separately, and the runtime
loads Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B and zhuhz22/Causal-Forcing weights (both
published under Apache License 2.0) downloaded by the administrator. See
docs/LICENSING.md.

